### Test 1: Update - Due date and priority
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/update
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobIds": [
    7001,
    7002
  ],
  "dueDate": "2026-10-08T12:00:00",
  "jobPriority": 1
}

### Test 2: Update - Reschedule
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/update
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobIds": [
    7001
  ],
  "reschedule": true,
  "startDate": "2026-10-09T08:00:00",
  "dueDate": "2026-10-09T12:00:00"
}

### Test 3: Update - Invalid (start after due)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/update
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobIds": [
    7001
  ],
  "startDate": "2026-10-09T13:00:00",
  "dueDate": "2026-10-09T12:00:00"
}
